{"about_the_game":"\u00abObject N\u00bb is a experimental hardcore retro game that tries to achieve aesthetics of old shooters such using modern open source Quake engine fork. In addition to graphical improvements (bump mapping, per-pixel lighting), the new engine adds new mechanics for movement, excessive gore effects, COOP mode and more.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe setting moves us to the Cold War. Step into the boots of a special Soviet engineer, dispatched to the clandestine government facility known only as \u00abObject N\u00bb. As you arrive, a mysterious disaster has struck, leaving the once-secret underground science center in chaos, now under military occupation. Uncover secret areas, solve puzzles, and confront unknown threats as you ascend from the depths to the surface.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"End of a line","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1508030/32d5a34b9210b4c949d9ef3ad632643e2ed90cd8.jpg"},{"name":"Treasure hunt: E1M2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1508030/baca8a14525c9cafe99abe9e2ee775ffef529f5c.jpg"},{"name":"F6 Veteran","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1508030/1801c108c41ecc1cce7bc9aa2196819519c9803e.jpg"},{"name":"Speedrun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1508030/a817e77381b2f4a26303b37411fda8ef4c79cfd1.jpg"},{"name":"Guys, we're going to live!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1508030/9b7493e64524684f7e7328578140ff623b16dc17.jpg"},{"name":"About that beer I owe ya! ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1508030/ec4e6ea3dbff535c6be20910926c39a7b72c1085.jpg"},{"name":"Sharpshooter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1508030/5e61c7caff345dc53854c942ed8926b1e48f63b2.jpg"},{"name":"First dose","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/s